{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>Tzafenat Pa'neach</b> — notarikon: צדיק פטפט נפש תאוה פוטיפר ענה נפשו חנם — a righteous one spoke, [concerning] the lustful soul of Potiphar, he answered his soul for nothing. Alternatively: צופה פודה נביא תומך פותר עניו נביא חוזה — seer, redeemer, prophet, sustainer, solver, humble, prophet, visionary."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:10.450552180Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}